          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A fair water heater quote is one where every dollar above the heater itself is tied to a line item you can name: labor, permit, haul-away, and specific code upgrades. Most of the variation between quotes comes from those extras, and most of them exist because current code asks for things your old installation did not have.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            If your heater still works and is approaching ten years old, now is the cheapest time to plan its replacement. Get two itemized quotes, decide calmly whether to stay with a tank or switch types, and check our gas water heater picks before you sign.
          </p>
